{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower defense meets deck building in Deck Defense. Defending against the blobs is no easy feat. Will you prioritise fortifying your tower defenses or expanding the map? Build your deck with over 75 cards to choose from. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bolster Your Defense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794280/extras/3afac9c102d018ce1cb0bfc588f35293.avif?t=1753794312\" width=616 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your defenses, with a wide range of towers to choose from. Deck Defense includes 34 towers, with a wide variety of attack styles, damage types and functionalities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Perfect Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794280/extras/5978b347144dc258532eaaa6dd0b0efd.poster.avif?t=1753794312\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794280/extras/5978b347144dc258532eaaa6dd0b0efd.webm?t=1753794312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794280/extras/5978b347144dc258532eaaa6dd0b0efd.mp4?t=1753794312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map expansion is in your hands. Craft the perfect map for your tower placements, but with a limited mana pool you\u2019ll have to choose whether to prioritise expanding the map or placing more towers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Counter Varying Waves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794280/extras/5c083aaa2aae2357a1973fb3acacafaa.avif?t=1753794312\" width=616 height=283 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 7 colours of blobs, each with their own resistances and weaknesses, and 5 types of wave modifiers, you\u2019ll need to balance your defences to hold up against any potential threat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand Your Deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794280/extras/b0d7de698399e26254a4620c94547db2.poster.avif?t=1753794312\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794280/extras/b0d7de698399e26254a4620c94547db2.webm?t=1753794312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794280/extras/b0d7de698399e26254a4620c94547db2.mp4?t=1753794312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck Defense has over 75 cards to unlock, including 35 towers, 12 powers, 12 spells, and 15 map pieces. Use these cards to perfect your strategy, however you\u2019ll need to adapt to what cards are available to you.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Kill 1000 Blobs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2794280/2432c1f1c4f3a71ac011e5ffc113637cb2da630a.jpg"},{"name":"Kill 10,000 Blobs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2794280/7a9de01ed29fd279b3acbd598b1b12f1845a60e5.jpg"},{"name":"Kill 100,000 Blobs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2794280/e1b32f99fed7d4d64588c58ca267d41756b95698.jpg"},{"name":"Victory!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2794280/faaa1353737655b648ca8cfe1ef651c7ce4ebf73.jpg"},{"name":"Mastered!","path